      "schema_version": "aspr_gear",
      "text": "This study examines whether voluntary carbon-credit retirement is associated with historical scope 1-emission change or climate-target ambition among 89 multinational firms in oil and gas, automobile manufacturing, and aviation. It reports no significant sample-wide association, while qualitative evidence identifies potential competition with internal decarbonisation for a small group of large-scale offsetters."
